{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56167","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 七 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庚午首，水旱俱应有。\n船行陆路中，牵马湖中走。\n夏旱忧百日，秋遭三六九。\n禾定出高田，秋收早冬首。\n晚刈必逢灾，兵革起非久。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}